    <briefdescription>
<para>Device identification and version information. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The ICVID register contains device type and silicon revision information. Format: [15:8] = Device Type, [7:0] = Silicon Revision</para>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>Exact values should be verified against specific datasheet revision. The TLE92466ED family may have multiple device variants. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
